            <div class="feature-list-item">
                <h3>Checks every purchase against what you asked for</h3>
                <p>You told the agent to book a flight under $400. Paybots checks the purchase against that intent, not just your card balance. If the charge doesn't match what you asked, it doesn't go through.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-list-item">
