        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <div class="feature-list">
            <div class="feature-list-item">
                <h3>1. Confirm.</h3>
                <p>At first, every purchase your agent wants to make pings you for a quick yes-or-no. Nothing happens without your tap.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-list-item">
                <h3>2. Set the rules.</h3>
                <p>Once you've seen the agent get a few right, you set the boundaries: limits, merchants, categories. The agent works inside them.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-list-item">
                <h3>3. Let it run.</h3>
                <p>Over time, as Paybots learns what you want, the boundaries loosen. Eventually the agent can act on intent alone, on purchases Paybots backs end to end.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
